  "boundary_evidence": [
    "One contiguous public WBT API run, 0x02065050..0x02065c2c, 36 functions gapless in config/arm9/delinks.txt; it starts immediately after the internal context run folded into wbt_context.c. NitroSDK libraries/wbt/src/meson.build names wbt_context.c and wbt_api.c as the library's two implementation files.",
    "The run contains the MP hooks, init/teardown, block registration and command-queue entry points. Its initialized words at 0x0209a070..0x0209a078 are the receive retry cursor and own-aid value; the terminal bss allocation at 0x020a94c0..0x020aa420 was already source-owned through WBT_End and is retained as one object because many configured interior labels land inside it."
